This repo uses Product-Helper.

- Re-read `.product-helper/GUARDRAILS.md` (defaults + Custom) before acting.
- After a feature, update TaskTrack, PRODUCT.md, and TIMELINE.md. Do not ask the human to run `sync`.
- Cards are features only — not small bug fixes.
- In this Product-Helper repo, `.product-helper/` stays in git. In consumer repos it is gitignored.
- The human is the PM. Never invent completed work.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/product-helper/SKILL.md`
